{"v":4,"catch":"Retro Kart Rush 是一款復古賽車遊戲，將帶您回到 16 位時代。","desc":"Retro Kart Rush 是一款復古賽車遊戲，將帶您回到 16 位時代。 通過在電視前玩多人遊戲來建立（或破壞）友誼。\n\n具有像素化的角色、街機物理和遊戲玩法，既易於學習又足夠深入，足以滿足該類型的老手。\n\n特徵：\n- 杯賽、單場比賽和計時賽模式。\n- 單人遊戲或多人分屏遊戲，適合 2 名玩家！\n- 4 種不同的難度設置，適合各個級別的玩家。\n- 8 個不同的杯子和 18 條獨特的軌道\n- 9個具有不同屬性的角色","publisher":"TuanisApps","release":"2023-10-05","genres":["競速","運動","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["英文","西班牙文","葡萄牙文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/44efeb7df393ce78f590992ce91b52a45efca6fed87ce1738712297f5abd866a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a8914ec815e806cb51d2bef3b7be835d2520812e1d5882de952b884caecbf238.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/43054dab7262290fd42cb148739a403749969f8f928085f8a37307647609ad82.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b3472ca4a14494525144a144db6da9f61948400052ba56351a555e12a0c211ed.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ba90fb543a52bcc5abb175b06df745cfdfc20f6abe242bd816a35e8b64dd154b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9d2e14e6ad46410240633b2a63fc7391ee7dfa34f01537d300c2e5d1511a82f6.jpg"],"titleId":"0100b0101c718000","dlc":[]}